# Course-owned assertions

Put scientifically meaningful checks here after deciding what each notebook is
intended to establish. Prefer invariants and property checks over brittle full
output snapshots. Define every tolerance from the numerical method, scale, and
expected variability; do not copy an unexplained tolerance from another test.

This scaffold deliberately generates no assertion function. A vacuous
placeholder such as `assert True` would create false confidence. Until explicit
checks are added, a runner `pass` establishes notebook execution only.
